The features folder is the client's feature-sliced UI: each subdirectory owns one gameplay surface. arena (board renderer + useMatch hook), match (local human-vs-Greedy loop over the arena), army-builder (pick race×class units under a mode budget, then start a mirrored match), scenario (manually drive both sides over a ScenarioSimulator), simulator (Phase 6 — a headless AI-vs-AI batch dashboard over the engine sim/ that reports win-rate/draw/turn-limit/avg-turn balance metrics), and net (Phase 7 — online multiplayer over the server-authoritative /ws/kt gateway: a transport + useKtMatch hook + OnlineMatchScreen that plays the reused Arena from server snapshots, no local rules). All six are wired into nav (App router).
